{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by her curiosity, join Valerie in a bubbly 2D adventure through valley forests and esoteric dreams to encounter unusual characters, hidden secrets, and maybe even some<i> feline friends!</i> But as the great outdoors beckons, a mysterious secret society has taken note of her presence...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Step inside the free demo today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/6b95f089784589b7229d811d3c2e32e7.poster.avif?t=1759510989\" width=798 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/6b95f089784589b7229d811d3c2e32e7.webm?t=1759510989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/6b95f089784589b7229d811d3c2e32e7.mp4?t=1759510989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Demo runtime: 30-60 mins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/1d9f76d281eb132cc793e353f275c1ec.avif?t=1759510989\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Unbound Mind</i>\u00a0was a book that sparked great controversy; many who read it mistakenly believed it had opened their mind to paranormal powers. Very few truly grasped its rigorous teachings, but from those who did, <strong>The Unbound Society</strong> was formed - a small elite group with ambitious ideals and intent to form greater order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows a girl named Valerie who was able to attain these powers, but was separate from those ideals. Her mother, wishing to realise the high expectations she had for her daughter, discovers\u00a0<strong>The Unbound Society</strong>, and takes her to them in the hope that they can light the way to Valerie's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/d6577e2b0c64a6f5049681650d4fa720.avif?t=1759510989\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her powers aren't all that useful for fighting, but they're fun! Use the <strong>boost</strong> ability to propel yourself, and the\u00a0<strong>bubble-gun</strong> ability to trap things in bubbles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/d5a54ff80a5d3152dcb92f656ada6aea.poster.avif?t=1759510989\" width=970 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/d5a54ff80a5d3152dcb92f656ada6aea.webm?t=1759510989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/d5a54ff80a5d3152dcb92f656ada6aea.mp4?t=1759510989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a bit of practice, these powers will let you find your own way to traverse the landscape and solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funky and unique platforming with bubbles, bouncing, boosting and slopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, light-hearted sprinkle of humour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artwork, soundtrack and story created by the developer, Jole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret collectibles to find such as trinkets\u00a0and health power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of cats (sometimes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/extras/banner_walk0.gif?t=1759510989\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Wishlist the game today and follow on socials for progress -</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The full release will only be possible with your support!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591070?t=1759510989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591070?t=1759510989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/45c035a0cb598cf2471beb690887d5b595bd6ef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759510989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591070/45c035a0cb598cf2471beb690887d5b595bd6ef9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759510989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by her curiosity, join Valerie in a bubbly 2D adventure through valley forests and esoteric dreams to encounter unusual characters, hidden secrets, and maybe even some<i> feline friends!</i> But as the great outdoors beckons, a mysterious secret society has taken note of her presence...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap